        "name": "\u001b[31m00303312 Configuration Error\n\u001b[31mError Message: Cannot find the corresponding SDK version under the specified SDK path. SDK path: /Users/raychen/Library/OpenHarmony/Sdk.\n\u001b[31m\n* Try the following:\n  > Choose Help > Edit Custom Properties to open idea.properties, and check whether an SDK path is configured. If so, ensure it points to the correct path and matches the built-in SDK version of DevEco Studio; otherwise, delete the custom path.\n  > Ensure that the DEVECO_SDK_HOME environment variable points to the correct SDK path and matches the built-in SDK version of DevEco Studio.\n  > Check whether @ohos/hvigor-ohos-plugin or @ohos/hvigor dependencies are configured in the dependencies field of hvigor-config.json5. If so, delete them. The current DevEco Studio uses the all-in-one installation mode and the built-in hvigor plugins are used by default, requiring no additional configuration.\n  > More info: https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides/ide-hvigor-errorcode-00303-1#section515641975611\n\u001b[39m\n\n\u001b[31m* Try:\n> Run with --stacktrace option to get the stack trace.\n> Run with --debug option to get more log output.\n",
